rs-power adapts power-flow formulations and result allocation from MATPOWER
8.1, tag commit 3f8ecfdbc79b07697d6b45f8d868ac1c2d27f788:
https://github.com/MATPOWER/matpower/tree/8.1

Relevant upstream routines include makeYbus, makeBdc, makeSbus, newtonpf,
dSbus_dV, makeB (the fast decoupled B' and B'' simplifications), pfsoln, bustypes, ext2int, int2ext, runpf, psse_read, psse_parse,
psse_parse_line, psse_convert, psse_convert_xfmr and psse_convert_hvdc.
